    {
      "type": "action",
      "name": "Stunning Fist",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "passive"
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>When you target the same creature with two strikes from flurry of blows, you can try to stun the creature. If either strike hits and deals damage, the target must succeed a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:34|traits:incapacitation] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{stunned 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{stunned 3} on a critical failure). This is an incapacitation effect.</p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
